n": 0}, {"completions": [{"text": "That means that $b + 4 = \\frac{3}{5}(a + 4)$.", "rating": 1, "flagged": null}], "human_completion": null, "chosen_completion": 0}, {"completions": [{"text": "I can simplify this by multiplying both sides by 5, and get $5b + 20 = 3a + 12$.", "rating": 1, "flagged": null}], "human_completion": null, "chosen_completion": 0}, {"completions": [{"text": "Now I have three equations and three unknowns, so I can try to solve for them.", "rating": 1, "flagged": null}], "human_completion": null, "chosen_completion": 0}, {"completions": [{"text": "I will start by substituting $c = a + 4$ into the first equation, $a + b + c = 18$.", "rating": 1, "flagged": null}], "human_completion": null, "chosen_completion": 0}, {"completions": [{"text": "This gives me $a + b + (a + 4) = 18$.", "rating": 1, "flagged": null}], "human_completion": null, "chosen_completion": 0}, {"completions": [{"text": "I can simplify this by combining like terms, and get $2a + b + 4 = 18$.", "rating": 1, "flagged": null}], "human_completion": null, "chosen_completion": 0}, {"completions": [{"text": "Next, I will try to eliminate $b$ from the second equation, $5b + 20 = 3a + 12$, by using the equation I just got.", "rating": 1, "flagged": null}], "human_completion": null, "chosen_completion": 0}, {"completions": [{"text": "I will multiply the equation $2a + b + 4 = 18$ by 5, and get $10a + 5b + 20 = 90$.", "rating": 1, "flagged": null}], "human_completion": null, "chosen_completion": 0}, {"completions": [{"text": "Then I will subtract the equation $5b + 20 = 3a + 12$ from this one, and get $7a = 78$.", "rating": -1, "flagged": null}, {"text": "Then I will subtract the equation $5b + 20 = 3a + 12$ from it, and get $7a = 78$.", "rating": -1, "flagged": false}, {"text": "Then I will subtract the equation $5b + 20 = 3a + 12$ from that, and get $7a = 78$.", "rating": -1, "flagged": false}], "human_completion": null, "chosen_completion": null}], "total_time": 595197, "finish_reason